#: gtt/0x1c767903/0xb6f0/0
msgid "Super Co-Op Weapon, Railgun."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0xb760 (id 0x74, record 0), budget 48 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0xb760/0
msgid "Ultimate Co-Op Weapon, Electromagnetic Wave Gun."
msgstr "终极合作武器，电磁波枪。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0xb7e0 (id 0x7e, record 0), budget 24 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0xb7e0/0
msgid "Ultimate Co-Op Weapon..."
msgstr "终极合作武器……"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0xb7e0 (id 0x7e, record 0), budget 16 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0xb7e0/1
msgid "Human Slingshot."
msgstr "人体弹弓。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0xb860 (id 0x79, record 0), budget 49 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0xb860/0
msgid "Super Co-Op Recovery Weapon! Electromagnetic Net!"
msgstr "超级合作回收武器！电磁网！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0xb8e0 (id 0x73, record 0), budget 43 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0xb8e0/0
msgid "Super Recovery Weapon! Electromagnetic Net!"
msgstr "超级回收武器！电磁网！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0xba50 (id 0x80, record 0), budget 27 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0xba50/0
msgid "Ultimate Combined Weapon..."
msgstr "终极合体武器……"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x0 (id 0xd6, record 84), budget 32 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x0/0
msgid "Miller here. Do you copy, Snake?"
msgstr "米勒。收到吗，SNAKE？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x0 (id 0xd6, record 84), budget 20 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x0/1
msgid "I see you've landed."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x0 (id 0xd6, record 84), budget 33 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x0/2
msgid "That makes one giant leap for us."
msgstr "这是我们的一大步。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0xe0 (id 0x1b3, record 84), budget 60 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0xe0/0
msgid ""
"I'm sending this from the offshore\n"
"plant - our Mother Base."
msgstr "我从海上\n工厂发信——母基地。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0xe0 (id 0x1b3, record 84), budget 29 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0xe0/1
msgid "The signal is unidirectional."
msgstr "信号是单向的。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0xe0 (id 0x1b3, record 84), budget 61 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0xe0/2
msgid ""
"I'll be giving you commands and advice\n"
"through this channel."
msgstr "我会通过这个频道\n下达指令和建议。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0xe0 (id 0x1b3, record 84), budget 56 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0xe0/3
msgid ""
"Keep your headphones on at all times\n"
"and pay attention."
msgstr "随时戴好耳机\n注意听。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0xe0 (id 0x1b3, record 84), budget 43 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0xe0/4
msgid ""
"Also, make sure no one else\n"
"can listen in."
msgstr "另外，确保没有别人\n能偷听。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x2a0 (id 0xb4, record 84), budget 38 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x2a0/0
msgid ""
"Snake,\n"
"are you clear on the controls?"
msgstr "SNAKE，\n操作都清楚了吗？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x2a0 (id 0xb4, record 84), budget 37 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x2a0/1
msgid "Take a minute to refresh your memory."
msgstr "花点时间回忆一下。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x360 (id 0x61, record 84), budget 21 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x360/0
msgid "Use <I=MOVE> to move."
msgstr "用<I=MOVE>移动。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x440 (id 0xd8, record 84), budget 60 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x440/0
msgid ""
"There's no one around - why not try\n"
"some shooting practice?"
msgstr "周围没人——不如试试\n射击练习？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x440 (id 0xd8, record 84), budget 48 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x440/1
msgid ""
"Select a target and squeeze off\n"
"a round or two."
msgstr "选个目标，开\n一两枪。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x520 (id 0xa6, record 84), budget 37 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x520/0
msgid "How about a little shooting practice?"
msgstr "来点射击练习如何？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x520 (id 0xa6, record 84), budget 22 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x520/1
msgid "Try hitting a coconut."
msgstr "试试打椰子。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x5d0 (id 0x83, record 84), budget 72 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x5d0/0
msgid ""
"Oil drums, driftwood, buoys... There are\n"
"plenty of targets around here."
msgstr "油桶、浮木、浮标……\n这附近目标不少。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x660 (id 0x89, record 84), budget 62 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x660/0
msgid ""
"That weapon won't help you put\n"
"the lime in the coconut, Boss."
msgstr "那武器可没法帮你\n把青柠塞进椰子，BOSS。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x6f0 (id 0x84, record 84), budget 50 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x6f0/0
msgid ""
"The tranquilizer gun wasn't made\n"
"to break things."
msgstr "麻醉枪可不是用来\n搞破坏的。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x780 (id 0x161, record 84), budget 21 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x780/0
msgid "Ah, a perfect target."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x780 (id 0x161, record 84), budget 59 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x780/1
msgid ""
"Looks like you won't be the first to\n"
"put some holes in it."
msgstr "看来你不是第一个\n在它身上打洞的人。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x780 (id 0x161, record 84), budget 25 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x780/2
msgid "Some \"peaceful paradise.\""
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x780 (id 0x161, record 84), budget 64 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x780/3
msgid ""
"That means you're not alone\n"
"out there. The enemy could be near."
msgstr "说明你不是一个人。\n敌人可能就在附近。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x8f0 (id 0x97, record 84), budget 76 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x8f0/0
msgid ""
"Why not sharpen your skills here a bit...\n"
"before you bump into one of them."
msgstr "不如先在这练练手……\n免得撞上他们。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x990 (id 0x107, record 84), budget 65 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x990/0
msgid ""
"Using auto-aim enables you to quickly\n"
"draw a bead on the target."
msgstr "用自动瞄准能快速\n锁定目标。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x990 (id 0x107, record 84), budget 69 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x990/1
msgid ""
"It's not entirely reliable, though.\n"
"If you want accuracy, go manual."
msgstr "不过不太可靠。\n想精准就手动瞄。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0xaa0 (id 0xe5, record 84), budget 38 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0xaa0/0
msgid "Auto-aim only works with live targets."
msgstr "自动瞄准只对活目标有效。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0xaa0 (id 0xe5, record 84), budget 57 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0xaa0/1
msgid ""
"That means it won't snap to\n"
"some threats, so be careful."
msgstr "有些威胁它锁不上，\n小心点。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0xb90 (id 0x8f, record 84), budget 78 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0xb90/0
msgid ""
"The over-the-shoulder view allows you\n"
"to aim with a high degree of precision."
msgstr "越肩视角能让你\n高精度瞄准。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0xc20 (id 0xde, record 84), budget 30 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0xc20/0
msgid "Body part targeting correction"
msgstr "部位瞄准修正"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0xc20 (id 0xde, record 84), budget 60 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0xc20/1
msgid ""
"will automatically shift your aim\n"
"to hit nearby body parts."
msgstr "会自动调整准心\n命中附近部位。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0xd00 (id 0x8c, record 84), budget 69 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0xd00/0
msgid ""
"If you want to change the aim\n"
"settings, take a look under \"OPTIONS.\""
msgstr "想改瞄准设置，\n去“OPTIONS”里看看。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0xd90 (id 0x141, record 84), budget 72 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0xd90/0
msgid ""
"Hitting an enemy's vital points can\n"
"bring them down with a single shot."
msgstr "击中敌人要害能\n一枪放倒。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0xd90 (id 0x141, record 84), budget 48 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0xd90/1
msgid ""
"You can also intentionally avoid\n"
"lethal shots -"
msgstr "你也可以故意避开\n致命射击——"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0xd90 (id 0x141, record 84), budget 46 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0xd90/2
msgid ""
"say if you just want to slow\n"
"the target down."
msgstr "比如只想让\n目标慢下来。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0xee0 (id 0x59, record 84), budget 26 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0xee0/0
msgid "I think you got him, Boss."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0xf40 (id 0x69, record 84), budget 29 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0xf40/0
msgid "That's one tough scarecrow..."
msgstr "这稻草人真硬……"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0xfb0 (id 0x69, record 84), budget 41 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0xfb0/0
msgid ""
"Enough, Boss.\n"
"You're wasting ammunition."
msgstr "够了，BOSS。\n你在浪费弹药。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x1020 (id 0x71, record 84), budget 40 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x1020/0
msgid ""
"Ammo doesn't grow on trees,\n"
"you know..."
msgstr "弹药可不是\n树上长的……"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x10a0 (id 0x70, record 84), budget 35 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x10a0/0
msgid "Use <I=CAMERA> to adjust your view."
msgstr "用<I=CAMERA>调整视角。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x1260 (id 0xde, record 84), budget 41 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x1260/0
msgid "Tilt <I=MOVE> left or right while holding"
msgstr "按住<I=MOVE>的同时左右倾斜"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x1260 (id 0xde, record 84), budget 35 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x1260/1
msgid "<I=WEAPONWINDOW> to switch weapons."
msgstr "用<I=WEAPONWINDOW>切换武器。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x1340 (id 0xd6, record 84), budget 42 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x1340/0
msgid "To select a weapon, hold <I=WEAPONWINDOW>,"
msgstr "按住<I=WEAPONWINDOW>选武器，"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x1340 (id 0xd6, record 84), budget 56 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x1340/1
msgid "then tilt <I=MOVE> left or right to make your selection."
msgstr "再左右推<I=MOVE>选择。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x1420 (id 0xb6, record 84), budget 22 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x1420/0
msgid "To choose your weapon,"
msgstr "选择武器时，"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x1420 (id 0xb6, record 84), budget 54 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x1420/1
msgid "hold <I=WEAPONWINDOW> and tilt <I=MOVE> left or right."
msgstr "按住<I=WEAPONWINDOW>并左右推<I=MOVE>。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x14e0 (id 0xd3, record 84), budget 38 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x14e0/0
msgid "Press the left or right <I=MOVE> while"
msgstr "按住左或右 <I=MOVE>，同时"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x14e0 (id 0xd3, record 84), budget 44 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x14e0/1
msgid ""
"holding <I=WEAPONWINDOW> to switch\n"
"weapons."
msgstr "按住 <I=WEAPONWINDOW> 以切换\n武器。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x15c0 (id 0x9d, record 84), budget 31 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x15c0/0
msgid "Ready your weapon with <I=AIM>."
msgstr "用<I=AIM>举枪。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x15c0 (id 0x9d, record 84), budget 27 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x15c0/1
msgid "Then press <I=ATK> to fire."
msgstr "再按<I=ATK>开火。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x1710 (id 0xbd, record 84), budget 33 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x1710/0
msgid "Press <I=ATK> to aim your weapon."
msgstr "按<I=ATK>举枪瞄准。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x1710 (id 0xbd, record 84), budget 46 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x1710/1
msgid "To use the weapon, press <I=ATK> while aiming."
msgstr "瞄准时按<I=ATK>使用武器。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x17d0 (id 0x88, record 84), budget 46 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x17d0/0
msgid "To stop aiming your weapon, press <I=QUITAIM>."
msgstr "按<I=QUITAIM>解除瞄准。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x1860 (id 0x6a, record 84), budget 39 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x1860/0
msgid ""
"Use <I=AIM> to\n"
"ready throwing weapons."
msgstr "用<I=AIM>准备\n投掷武器。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x1940 (id 0x6e, record 84), budget 47 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x1940/0
msgid "To ready a throwing-type weapon, press <I=ATK>."
msgstr "按<I=ATK>准备投掷武器。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x19b0 (id 0x7d, record 84), budget 52 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x19b0/0
msgid ""
"Once you've readied the weapon,\n"
"throw with <I=ATK>."
msgstr "准备好后，\n按<I=ATK>投掷。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x1a30 (id 0xc6, record 84), budget 28 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x1a30/0
msgid "When using throwing weapons,"
msgstr "使用投掷武器时，"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x1a30 (id 0xc6, record 84), budget 42 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x1a30/1
msgid "hold <I=ATK> down longer to throw farther."
msgstr "按住<I=ATK>越久投得越远。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x1b00 (id 0x7f, record 84), budget 58 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x1b00/0
msgid "You won't throw the weapon until you let go of the button."
msgstr "松开按键才会投出。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x1c00 (id 0xa3, record 84), budget 25 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x1c00/0
msgid "To use a throwing weapon,"
msgstr "使用投掷武器时，"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x1c00 (id 0xa3, record 84), budget 32 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x1c00/1
msgid "ready it and then press <I=ATK>."
msgstr "准备后按<I=ATK>。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x1cb0 (id 0xed, record 84), budget 54 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x1cb0/0
msgid ""
"To use the stun rod, first unequip\n"
"any other weapons."
msgstr "用电击棒前，先卸下\n其他武器。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x1cb0 (id 0xed, record 84), budget 51 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x1cb0/1
msgid "Then ready it with <I=AIM> and strike with <I=ATK>."
msgstr "再用<I=AIM>准备，按<I=ATK>攻击。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x1da0 (id 0xed, record 84), budget 48 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x1da0/0
msgid ""
"To use the stun rod, unequip\n"
"any other weapons,"
msgstr "用电击棒前，卸下\n其他武器，"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x1da0 (id 0xed, record 84), budget 53 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x1da0/1
msgid ""
"then ready it with <I=AIM> and strike\n"
"using <I=ATK>."
msgstr "再用<I=AIM>准备，按\n<I=ATK>攻击。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x1e90 (id 0xef, record 84), budget 37 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x1e90/0
msgid "To use a stun rod after equipping it,"
msgstr "装备电击棒后使用时，"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x1e90 (id 0xef, record 84), budget 22 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x1e90/1
msgid "ready it with <I=ATK>,"
msgstr "用<I=ATK>上膛，"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x1e90 (id 0xef, record 84), budget 25 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x1e90/2
msgid "then press <I=ATK> again."
msgstr "再按<I=ATK>。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x1f80 (id 0xd6, record 84), budget 43 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x1f80/0
msgid ""
"Press the BACK button\n"
"to turn on auto-aim."
msgstr "按BACK键\n开启自动瞄准。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x1f80 (id 0xd6, record 84), budget 32 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x1f80/1
msgid "Press BACK again to turn it off."
msgstr "再按BACK关闭。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x2060 (id 0xf0, record 84), budget 56 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x2060/0
msgid ""
"With auto-aim, you'll lock on to\n"
"enemies automatically."
msgstr "自动瞄准会自动\n锁定敌人。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x2060 (id 0xf0, record 84), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x2060/1
msgid ""
"Only problem is, you can't target\n"
"specific body parts."
msgstr "缺点是无法瞄准\n特定部位。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x2150 (id 0x8e, record 84), budget 56 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x2150/0
msgid ""
"Auto-aim effectiveness will vary from\n"
"weapon to weapon."
msgstr "自动瞄准效果因\n武器而异。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x21e0 (id 0xe4, record 84), budget 54 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x21e0/0
msgid ""
"The Mk. 22 tranquilizer gun can\n"
"put enemies to sleep."
msgstr "Mk. 22麻醉枪能\n让敌人睡着。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x21e0 (id 0xe4, record 84), budget 58 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x21e0/1
msgid ""
"The closer to the head you hit,\n"
"the more effective it is."
msgstr "越靠近头部命中，\n效果越好。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x22d0 (id 0x8e, record 84), budget 59 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x22d0/0
msgid ""
"Tranquilizer rounds are hard to\n"
"come by. Don't waste them."
msgstr "麻醉弹很稀缺，\n别浪费。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x2360 (id 0x79, record 84), budget 58 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x2360/0
msgid ""
"The M16's a standard assault rifle\n"
"capable of rapid-fire."
msgstr "M16是标准突击步枪，\n可连发。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x23e0 (id 0x6a, record 84), budget 41 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x23e0/0
msgid ""
"Grenades explode.\n"
"You throw them, Snake."
msgstr "手雷会爆炸。\n扔出去，SNAKE。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x2450 (id 0x59, record 84), budget 32 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x2450/0
msgid "That's right. Nicely done, Boss."
msgstr "没错。干得好，BOSS。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x24b0 (id 0x42, record 84), budget 8 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x24b0/0
msgid "Perfect."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x2500 (id 0x43, record 84), budget 10 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x2500/0
msgid "That's it."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x2550 (id 0xac, record 84), budget 82 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x2550/0
msgid ""
"Select equipment by tilting <I=MOVE> left\n"
"or right while holding <I=EQUIPWINDOW>."
msgstr "按住<I=EQUIPWINDOW>并左右拨<I=MOVE>\n选择装备。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x2600 (id 0xd8, record 84), budget 44 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x2600/0
msgid "Select equipment by holding <I=EQUIPWINDOW>,"
msgstr "按住<I=EQUIPWINDOW>选择装备，"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x2600 (id 0xd8, record 84), budget 57 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x2600/1
msgid ""
"then tilt <I=MOVE> left or\n"
"right to make your selection."
msgstr "然后左右拨<I=MOVE>\n进行选择。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x26e0 (id 0xcd, record 84), budget 25 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x26e0/0
msgid "To choose an item to use,"
msgstr "要选择使用道具，"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x26e0 (id 0xcd, record 84), budget 53 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x26e0/1
msgid "hold <I=EQUIPWINDOW> and tilt <I=MOVE> left or right."
msgstr "按住<I=EQUIPWINDOW>并左右拨<I=MOVE>。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x27b0 (id 0xad, record 84), budget 78 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x27b0/0
msgid ""
"Select equipment by pressing the left\n"
"or right while holding <I=EQUIPWINDOW>."
msgstr "按住<I=EQUIPWINDOW>并按左\n或右选择装备。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x2860 (id 0x81, record 84), budget 60 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x2860/0
msgid ""
"Your binoculars enable you to\n"
"gather recon from a distance."
msgstr "望远镜能让你\n远距离侦察。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x28f0 (id 0x7b, record 84), budget 39 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x28f0/0
msgid "To change your settings, open the menu."
msgstr "要更改设置，打开菜单。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x2970 (id 0x76, record 84), budget 33 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x2970/0
msgid "To check your map, open the menu."
msgstr "要查看地图，打开菜单。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x29f0 (id 0x150, record 84), budget 19 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x29f0/0
msgid "Be careful, though."
msgstr "但要小心。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x29f0 (id 0x150, record 84), budget 68 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x29f0/1
msgid ""
"The bad guys won't sit around waiting\n"
"while you mess with the menu."
msgstr "你翻菜单时敌人\n可不会干等着。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x29f0 (id 0x150, record 84), budget 30 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x29f0/2
msgid "No pausing in real life, Boss."
msgstr "现实没法暂停，BOSS。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x29f0 (id 0x150, record 84), budget 30 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x29f0/3
msgid "Not even in lovely Costa Rica."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x2b40 (id 0x83, record 84), budget 51 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x2b40/0
msgid ""
"The facility you're headed for is\n"
"past that fence."
msgstr "你要去的设施就在\n那道栅栏后面。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x2bd0 (id 0x73, record 84), budget 48 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x2bd0/0
msgid ""
"A grenade should be able to take\n"
"out that gate."
msgstr "手雷应该能炸开\n那扇门。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x2c50 (id 0x77, record 84), budget 37 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x2c50/0
msgid "Get rid of that door and keep moving."
msgstr "炸掉那扇门，继续前进。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x2cd0 (id 0x51, record 84), budget 14 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x2cd0/0
msgid "Use a grenade."
msgstr "用手雷。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x2d30 (id 0x79, record 84), budget 54 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x2d30/0
msgid ""
"You're gonna need a grenade to\n"
"get through that gate."
msgstr "你需要一枚手雷\n才能穿过那道门。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x2db0 (id 0x97, record 84), budget 71 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x2db0/0
msgid ""
"Good, you'll reach the objective\n"
"when you clear the jungle. Head east."
msgstr "很好，穿过丛林就能\n到达目标。往东走。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x2e50 (id 0x58, record 84), budget 18 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x2e50/0
msgid "Head east for now."
msgstr "先往东走。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x2eb0 (id 0x4e, record 84), budget 19 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x2eb0/0
msgid "Make your way east."
msgstr "往东前进。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x2f00 (id 0x82, record 84), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x2f00/0
msgid ""
"When you clear the jungle,\n"
"you'll be there. Head east."
msgstr "穿过丛林就到了。\n往东走。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x2f90 (id 0x8f, record 84), budget 60 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x2f90/0
msgid "Snake, don't you think you could use a little more practice?"
msgstr "SNAKE，你不觉得该多练练吗？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x3020 (id 0x74, record 84), budget 46 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x3020/0
msgid ""
"Out of ammo?\n"
"Is there any lying around there?"
msgstr "没弹药了？\n附近有没有掉落的？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x30a0 (id 0x7d, record 84), budget 58 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x30a0/0
msgid ""
"Take a good look around.\n"
"You could find some ammo nearby."
msgstr "仔细找找周围。\n附近可能有弹药。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x3120 (id 0x69, record 84), budget 30 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x3120/0
msgid "See any grenades lying around?"
msgstr "看到附近有手雷吗？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x3190 (id 0x72, record 84), budget 44 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x3190/0
msgid ""
"The rotating boxes are items.\n"
"Pick them up."
msgstr "旋转的箱子是道具。\n捡起来。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x3210 (id 0x75, record 84), budget 49 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x3210/0
msgid "You see some sorta weird animal over by the pier?"
msgstr "你在码头看到怪动物没？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x3290 (id 0x7c, record 84), budget 30 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x3290/0
msgid "Hey, a UMA! Look! By the pier!"
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x3310 (id 0x76, record 84), budget 41 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x3310/0
msgid "Man, I don't believe it! A real live UMA!"
msgstr "天哪！活的未知生物！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x3390 (id 0x62, record 84), budget 26 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x3390/0
msgid "I... I'm dreaming, right?!"
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x3400 (id 0x9b, record 84), budget 73 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x3400/0
msgid "Oh, he's so cute! I had no idea a creature like that lives in Costa Rica!"
msgstr "哦，好可爱！没想到哥斯达黎加有这种生物！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x34a0 (id 0x77, record 84), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x34a0/0
msgid "Oh, my word, so darling! Bring it back with you, Snake!"
msgstr "天啊，太可爱了！带回来吧，SNAKE！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x3520 (id 0xc0, record 84), budget 19 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x3520/0
msgid "Let me handle this."
msgstr "交给我吧。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x3520 (id 0xc0, record 84), budget 17 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x3520/1
msgid "Meow, meow, meow!"
msgstr "喵喵喵！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x3520 (id 0xc0, record 84), budget 6 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x3520/2
msgid "...Hm?"
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x3520 (id 0xc0, record 84), budget 16 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x3520/3
msgid "Is it not a cat?"
msgstr "不是猫吗？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x35e0 (id 0x7b, record 84), budget 51 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x35e0/0
msgid "There's...there's a man inside there, right? ...No?"
msgstr "那里面……有个人对吧？……没有？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x3660 (id 0x78, record 84), budget 63 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x3660/0
msgid "It's...it's walking on two legs?! I gotta take notes on this..."
msgstr "它…它用两条腿走路？！我得记下来…"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x36e0 (id 0xa4, record 84), budget 25 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x36e0/0
msgid "What is this creature...?"
msgstr "这生物是什么…？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x36e0 (id 0xa4, record 84), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x36e0/1
msgid "It's completely beyond the realm of my understanding..."
msgstr "完全超出我的理解范围…"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x3790 (id 0x70, record 84), budget 43 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x3790/0
msgid "Cut that out! What are you going to do now?"
msgstr "住手！你到底想干什么？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x3800 (id 0x61, record 84), budget 38 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x3800/0
msgid "What a terrible thing to do to a lady!"
msgstr "这样对待女士太恶劣了！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x3870 (id 0x71, record 84), budget 46 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x3870/0
msgid "Snake! What do you think you're doing to Paz?!"
msgstr "SNAKE！你想对帕兹做什么？！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x38f0 (id 0x7f, record 84), budget 62 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x38f0/0
msgid "What, may I ask, is your reason for doing such a thing to her?"
msgstr "请问，你对她做这种事有何理由？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x3970 (id 0x6b, record 84), budget 36 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x3970/0
msgid "What are you planning to do to her?!"
msgstr "你打算对她做什么？！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x39e0 (id 0x6b, record 84), budget 40 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x39e0/0
msgid "What exactly do you plan on doing, Boss?"
msgstr "BOSS，你到底打算做什么？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x3a50 (id 0x79, record 84), budget 49 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x3a50/0
msgid "I guess a little fun and games never hurt anyone."
msgstr "玩玩闹闹应该无伤大雅吧。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x3ad0 (id 0x70, record 84), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x3ad0/0
msgid "What exactly do you plan to do with Monsieur Miller...?"
msgstr "你到底打算对米勒先生做什么…？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x3b40 (id 0x5f, record 84), budget 33 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x3b40/0
msgid "I thought Miller was your friend!"
msgstr "我以为米勒是你的朋友！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x3ba0 (id 0x107, record 84), budget 54 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x3ba0/0
msgid "What you two choose to do with your time is up to you,"
msgstr "你们俩怎么打发时间随你们，"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x3ba0 (id 0x107, record 84), budget 22 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x3ba0/1
msgid "but I am not impressed"
msgstr "但我可不欣赏"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x3ba0 (id 0x107, record 84), budget 52 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x3ba0/2
msgid "with knocking someone out to take advantage of them."
msgstr "把人打晕再占便宜的做法。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f20b block 0x3cb0 (id 0x72, record 84), budget 43 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f20b/0x3cb0/0
msgid "I don't think I'll ever understand you two."
msgstr "我想我永远搞不懂你们俩。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f24b block 0x0 (id 0x6f, record 144), budget 39 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f24b/0x0/0
msgid "Chico's in a prison camp north of here."
msgstr "奇科在北面的战俘营。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f24b block 0x70 (id 0xc9, record 144), budget 61 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f24b/0x70/0
msgid "The basin ahead leaves you completely exposed to sniper fire."
msgstr "前方盆地会让你完全暴露在狙击火力下。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f24b block 0x70 (id 0xc9, record 144), budget 32 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f24b/0x70/1
msgid "I have a bad feeling about this."
msgstr "我有种不祥的预感。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f24b block 0x140 (id 0xe0, record 144), budget 45 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f24b/0x140/0
msgid "That basin will leave you completely exposed."
msgstr "那片盆地会让你完全暴露。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f24b block 0x140 (id 0xe0, record 144), budget 67 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f24b/0x140/1
msgid "If I were the enemy, I'd position snipers there. Better be careful."
msgstr "换我是敌人，会在那里布狙击手。小心点。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f24b block 0x220 (id 0x88, record 144), budget 64 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f24b/0x220/0
msgid "Sniper! Better be careful if you don't want your head blown off."
msgstr "狙击手！不想脑袋开花就小心点。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f24b block 0x2b0 (id 0x7a, record 144), budget 48 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f24b/0x2b0/0
msgid "They're using the scarecrow for sniper training."
msgstr "他们用稻草人做狙击训练。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f24b block 0x330 (id 0x71, record 144), budget 47 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f24b/0x330/0
msgid "A scarecrow... Just like that one on the coast."
msgstr "稻草人…跟海岸边那个一样。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f24b block 0x3b0 (id 0xb0, record 144), budget 42 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f24b/0x3b0/0
msgid "There's a coffee factory to the northeast."
msgstr "东北方有座咖啡工厂。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f24b block 0x3b0 (id 0xb0, record 144), budget 32 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f24b/0x3b0/1
msgid "Beyond that is a train terminal."
msgstr "前方是火车终点站。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f24b block 0x460 (id 0x79, record 144), budget 57 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f24b/0x460/0
msgid "Make your way to the coffee plantation northeast of here."
msgstr "前往东北方的咖啡种植园。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f24b block 0x4e0 (id 0x70, record 144), budget 40 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f24b/0x4e0/0
msgid "Those tracks used to transport coffee..."
msgstr "那些铁轨曾用来运咖啡……"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f24b block 0x550 (id 0x99, record 144), budget 70 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f24b/0x550/0
msgid "Railroads in Costa Rica use 1,067 mm gauge tracks - the same as Japan."
msgstr "哥斯达黎加的铁路轨距是1067毫米，和日本一样。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f24b block 0x5f0 (id 0x71, record 144), budget 37 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f24b/0x5f0/0
msgid "Wonder if they use steam locomotives."
msgstr "不知道还用不用蒸汽机车。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f24b block 0x670 (id 0x6d, record 144), budget 37 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f24b/0x670/0
msgid "Head north if you want to find Chico."
msgstr "往北走就能找到奇科。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f24b block 0x6e0 (id 0x84, record 144), budget 61 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f24b/0x6e0/0
msgid "We've gotta save Chico, Snake. It's to our benefit, you know."
msgstr "得救奇科，SNAKE。这对我们有好处。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f24b block 0x770 (id 0x6a, record 144), budget 43 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f24b/0x770/0
msgid "They're using that village as a prison now."
msgstr "他们把那个村子当监狱用了。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f24b block 0x7e0 (id 0x6a, record 144), budget 39 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f24b/0x7e0/0
msgid "Boss, please... You have to help Chico."
msgstr "BOSS，求你了……帮帮奇科。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f24b block 0x850 (id 0x5e, record 144), budget 28 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f24b/0x850/0
msgid "Please, Snake. Help Chico..."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f24b block 0x8b0 (id 0x73, record 144), budget 51 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f24b/0x8b0/0
msgid "The train terminal is beyond the coffee plantation."
msgstr "火车终点站在咖啡种植园那边。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f24b block 0x930 (id 0x86, record 144), budget 70 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f24b/0x930/0
msgid "That cargo's bound for the rail terminal in El Cadalso - it has to be."
msgstr "那批货是运往绞刑台的火车站——一定是。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f24b block 0x9c0 (id 0x6f, record 144), budget 42 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f24b/0x9c0/0
msgid "The rail terminal should be in El Cadalso."
msgstr "火车终点站应该在绞刑台。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f24b block 0xa30 (id 0x97, record 144), budget 73 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f24b/0xa30/0
msgid "Destroy the barricade by the prison. That's the village where I was held."
msgstr "炸掉监狱旁的路障。我就是被关在那个村子。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f24b block 0xad0 (id 0x95, record 144), budget 64 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f24b/0xad0/0
msgid "Head for the prison where I was held. There's a barricade there."
msgstr "去我被关的监狱。那里有路障。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f24b block 0xb70 (id 0x67, record 144), budget 32 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f24b/0xb70/0
msgid "Use C4 to destroy the barricade."
msgstr "用C4炸掉路障。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f24b block 0xbe0 (id 0x8a, record 144), budget 71 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f24b/0xbe0/0
msgid "Apparently, that aqueduct north of the village also serves as a bridge."
msgstr "村子北边那条水渠好像也能当桥用。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f24b block 0xc70 (id 0x6d, record 144), budget 31 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f24b/0xc70/0
msgid "Head north. Look for the gorge."
msgstr "往北走。找峡谷。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f24b block 0xce0 (id 0x14c, record 144), budget 64 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f24b/0xce0/0
msgid "See those really big leaves around you? That's Gunnera Insignis."
msgstr "看到周围那些大叶子了吗？那是大叶草。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f24b block 0xce0 (id 0x14c, record 144), budget 63 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f24b/0xce0/1
msgid "It's also known as Sombrilla de Pobre, or \"Poor Man's Parasol\"."
msgstr "也叫Sombrilla de Pobre，穷人的阳伞。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f24b block 0xce0 (id 0x14c, record 144), budget 53 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f24b/0xce0/2
msgid "You can literally use it as a parasol if you want to."
msgstr "想的话真能拿它当伞用。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f24b block 0xe30 (id 0xfd, record 144), budget 21 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f24b/0xe30/0
msgid "Sombrilla de pobre..."
msgstr "穷人的阳伞……"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f24b block 0xe30 (id 0xfd, record 144), budget 48 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f24b/0xe30/1
msgid "I often use that whenever a champa isn't enough."
msgstr "帐篷不够用时我常拿它凑合。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f24b block 0xe30 (id 0xfd, record 144), budget 59 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f24b/0xe30/2
msgid "Sometimes the jungle is too wet for just one plastic sheet."
msgstr "丛林太潮，一块塑料布有时不够。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f2cb block 0x0 (id 0x8c, record 240), budget 69 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f2cb/0x0/0
msgid "Peace Walker's in a base due west of your current position. Move out!"
msgstr "和平行者在你正西方的基地。出发！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f2cb block 0x90 (id 0x63, record 240), budget 21 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f2cb/0x90/0
msgid "Go West, Snake. West."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f2cb block 0x100 (id 0xb4, record 240), budget 38 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f2cb/0x100/0
msgid "Not all enemies will be on the ground."
msgstr "敌人不一定都在地面。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f2cb block 0x100 (id 0xb4, record 240), budget 37 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f2cb/0x100/1
msgid "Watch for hostiles on the roofs, too."
msgstr "屋顶上也要小心敌人。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f2cb block 0x1c0 (id 0x6e, record 240), budget 41 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f2cb/0x1c0/0
msgid "A ladder. Now you can get up to the roof."
msgstr "有梯子。可以上屋顶了。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f2cb block 0x230 (id 0xd1, record 240), budget 17 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f2cb/0x230/0
msgid "In certain areas,"
msgstr "某些区域，"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f2cb block 0x230 (id 0xd1, record 240), budget 34 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f2cb/0x230/1
msgid "you may be able to get to the roof"
msgstr "你可以爬上屋顶，"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f2cb block 0x230 (id 0xd1, record 240), budget 36 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f2cb/0x230/2
msgid "by using wooden boxes as a platform."
msgstr "用木箱当踏板就行。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f2cb block 0x310 (id 0xbd, record 240), budget 48 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f2cb/0x310/0
msgid "My friends and I used to play on the roof a lot."
msgstr "我小时候常和朋友在屋顶玩。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f2cb block 0x310 (id 0xbd, record 240), budget 39 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f2cb/0x310/1
msgid "But if mi viejo saw us he would hit us."
msgstr "但被我老爹看见就会挨打。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f2cb block 0x3d0 (id 0x78, record 240), budget 50 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f2cb/0x3d0/0
msgid "Why haven't you tried the roof? Afraid of heights?"
msgstr "怎么不试试上屋顶？恐高？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f2cb block 0x450 (id 0x62, record 240), budget 39 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f2cb/0x450/0
msgid "Couldn't you get over there by hanging?"
msgstr "你不能吊着过去吗？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f2cb block 0x4c0 (id 0x6a, record 240), budget 42 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f2cb/0x4c0/0
msgid "I bet you could get over there by hanging."
msgstr "你吊着应该能过去。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f2cb block 0x530 (id 0x80, record 240), budget 50 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f2cb/0x530/0
msgid "Don't want to try hanging? Scared you'll fall off?"
msgstr "不想吊过去？怕摔下来？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f2cb block 0x5b0 (id 0xec, record 240), budget 64 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f2cb/0x5b0/0
msgid "I guess the only way to get around on that roof is by rolling..."
msgstr "那屋顶上恐怕只能靠翻滚移动……"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f2cb block 0x5b0 (id 0xec, record 240), budget 61 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f2cb/0x5b0/1
